        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBR1851, Solid Brass 18\" Rectangular Wire Basket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt 18\" long and 4-1/2\" wide, the Deltana Rectangular Wire Shelf is great for holding all your bathroom supplies from shampoo bottles to body wash. Its longer length means that there is plenty of room for shared bathrooms where everyone had their own soaps. But don't think that this shelf is made for the bathroom alone. It is the perfect solution for storage issues all over your home; and would be great for storing ingredients in your kitchen or toys in the kid's rooms. Made out of solid brass, the WBR1851 Wire Basket is available in polished chrome, satin nickel, and pvd polished brass finishes. It easily mounts to the wall.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1851-specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"596\" height=\"234\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBR1851 18\" Rectangular Wire Basket Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBR1851 Solid Brass Rectangular Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1851.pdf?v=1704262294\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBR1851 18\" Rectangular Wire Basket Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
