                "title": "Rectangular 18 Inch Wire Basket, Deltana WBR1851",
                "description": "Deltana WBR1851 Rectangular 18 Inch Wire Basket - At 18 inches long and 4-1/2 inches wide, the Deltana Rectangular Wire Shelf is great for holding all your bathroom supplies from shampoo bottles to body wash. Its longer length means that there is plenty of room for shared bathrooms where everyone had their own soaps. But don't think that this shelf is made for the bathroom alone. It is the perfect solution for storage issues all over your home; and would be great for storing ingredients in your kitchen or toys in the kid's rooms. Made out of solid brass, the WBR1851 Wire Basket is available in polished chrome, satin nickel, and pvd polished brass finishes. It easily mounts to the wall.",
